35,2,1,talk,Midori,,- **Midori**: The board minutes show the joint clinic collapsed because neither department would hold the budget line.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Misaki,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,- **Shion**: The ledger shows our development allocation is down by nearly a quarter.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: The car park fills before eleven, and the shuttle only reaches four of our nineteen villages.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Midori,,"- **Midori**: That confirms my fear. If the arrangement rests on a department that never signed up, it will break in year two.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,#### Turn 2 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Misaki,,#### Turn 2 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"- **Shion**: And home visits draw no tariff. We build it, we fund it, we earn nothing back.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: That means any new service must fit into the existing flow, or we will simply clog the system.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Midori,,"- **Midori**: So we must ensure every new program has a clear, single owner who is fully committed from day one.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: The booking system only logs named slots. If a program lacks fixed appointments, it vanishes from our records entirely.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: The therapy review shows four years of physiotherapists leaving, but midwifery has unusual slack.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,- **Shion**: So on-site sessions bill at the standard rate. Home visits earn nothing. The math is already against us.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: I see. If the car park is full by eleven, a new outpatient unit will just add to the congestion.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Midori,,"- **Midori**: Agreed. We need a program that fits our current capacity and has a clear, committed owner.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: Precisely. If it isn't booked, it didn't happen. We need a model that leaves a trace in the system.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Misaki,,- **Misaki**: Midwifery slack is the only staffing surplus I see. We cannot build on a foundation of agency cover.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shion,,"So we need on-site billing and a single, committed owner. Anything else is a leak.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shion"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Shion: So we need on-site billing and a single, committed owner. Anything else is a leak.""}]}"
54,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: Then we must choose something that fits the current rooms and parking, without adding to the morning rush.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
