60,3,1,talk,Midori,,- **Midori**: The candidates are here. Which one can we trust to stay whole in year two?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,- **Jonathan**: The booking system only records named slots. We need a program that fits that structure.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Misaki,,- **Misaki**: Midwifery has the slack. Perinatal support is the only one I can staff without agency cover.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shion,,"- **Shion**: Perinatal support is on-site, so it bills at the standard rate. The others are financial black holes.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shizue,,- **Shizue**: Perinatal support fits. It uses existing rooms and doesn't add to the morning parking rush.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Midori,,"- **Midori**: Perinatal support has a clear owner in the midwifery department, so it won't collapse like the joint clinic did.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: It uses fixed appointment slots, so it will actually appear in our activity reports.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Misaki,,- **Misaki**: The midwifery slack is real. We can staff this without touching the therapy rota or agency cover.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shion,,- **Shion**: On-site billing means it pays for itself. The others are just expensive hobbies.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: It fits the existing flow. No new parking, no extra shuttle strain. It simply works within what we have.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Midori,,"- **Midori**: I am convinced. It has a committed owner, fits our capacity, and will actually survive the second year.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,- **Jonathan**: It leaves a trace in the booking system. That is the only way we know it actually happened.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Misaki,,- **Misaki**: The staffing math is the only one that holds. I am ready to vote for Perinatal Support.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shion,,- **Shion**: The tariff math is the only one that balances. I am ready to vote for Perinatal Support.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shizue,,- **Shizue**: It fits the day without seizing up. I am ready to vote for Perinatal Support.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Midori,,- **Midori**: Then we are unanimous. I vote for Perinatal Support Service.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,- **Jonathan**: I vote for Perinatal Support Service.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
